# Keep the Docker build hermetic: the deploy checkout is also the build
# context, and host-side installs (running migration/import scripts on the
# server) leave node_modules trees whose pnpm symlinks are dead inside the
# image. Without this file, `COPY apps/web ./apps/web` clobbers the image's
# freshly installed dependencies with those dead links and the build fails
# with "Cannot find module '@astrojs/tailwind'".
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
**/.astro
**/dist
**/.turbo
*.log
